  "texts": {
    "preamble": "N.Senthil Kumar vs The Secretary To Government on 4 January, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.35499 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated :04.01.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.35499 of 2023 N.Senthil Kumar ..... Petitioner Vs 1 . The Secretary to Government, Health and Family Welfare Department, Secretariat, Chennai 600 009. 2. The Commissioner, Food Safety and Drug Administrative Department, Anna Salai, Chennai 600 006. 3. The Designated Officer, Food Safety and Drug Administrative Department, Kancheepuram District. Prayer:- Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution of I for the issuance of Writ of Mandamus, directing the respondents to consider the representation of petitioner dated 03.11.2023 and consequently directing the respondents to pay additional charge allowance for working as additional charge food safety officer to Sriperumbudur Block from 10.01.2022 to till date. For Petitioner : Mr.U.Jugal Kumar For Respondents : Dr.T.Seenivasan Special Government Pleader Page 1 of 4 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.No.3 Order N.Senthil Kumar vs The Secretary To Government on 4 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/30375350/ 1",
    "facts": "He has been appointed as full additional charge Food Safety Officer of Sriperumbudur Block by the proceeding dated 06.01.2022. Therefore, the petitioner is not entitled for additional charge allowance.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
